figcaption class=caption><deepai-caption class="caption__inner caption--collapsed caption--fill"><div class="caption__text text-caption" id=caption-c3e18f3b-5ed3-44f7-b846-2506a8d5fa78><p data-block-key=von4y>Prompt: glitch electronica, chopped stuttering percussion, soft clicks, vinyl dust, warm evolving pads, soft airy female vocal, phrases sliced and re-pitched into glitch textures, breathy sustained notes</p></div><button class="caption__expand button button--tonal icon-center icon-center--md" aria-controls=caption-c3e18f3b-5ed3-44f7-b846-2506a8d5fa78 aria-expanded=false aria-label=Expand><div class=button__icon><span class=icon-sm-outlined><svg viewbox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden=true fill=currentColor height=18px role=presentation width=18px xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg><path d=M457.31-457.31H220v-45.38h237.31V-740h45.38v237.31H740v45.38H502.69V-220h-45.38v-237.31Z /></svg></span></div></button><button class="caption__collapse button button--tonal icon-center icon-center--md" aria-controls=caption-c3e18f3b-5ed3-44f7-b846-2506a8d5fa78 aria-expanded=true aria-label=Collapse><div class=button__icon><span class=icon-sm-outlined><svg viewbox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden=true fill=currentColor height=18px role=presentation width=18px xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg><path d=M220-457.31v-45.38h520v45.38H220Z /></svg></span></div></button></deepai-caption></figcaption></figure></div></div></article></div></div></div><div class=carousel__pagination><div><div class=combo-button-group><button aria-controls=carousel-f214b718-021a-4f0f-96b1-bed9764780a9 aria-label=Previous class=js-carousel__button--prev><span aria-hidden=true class=icon-md-fill> <svg viewbox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden=true fill=currentColor height=24px role=presentation width=24px xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg><path d="M560.62-253.85 333.85-480.62l226.77-227.15 32.61 32.62-194.15 194.53 194.15 194.16-32.61 32.61Z"/></svg> </span></button><button aria-controls=carousel-f214b718-021a-4f0f-96b1-bed