<span aria-hidden=true class=icon-md-outlined data-icon=chevron_right></span></button></div></div><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-md-bottom spacer-block-md-top section--only-jumplinks" id=jump-links><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-12"></div></section><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-lg-bottom spacer-block-md-top" id=models><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-12"><div class=grid__column--span-12><div class="section-header section-header--small section-header--stacked section-header--no-paragraphs section-header--paragraphs-left section-header--paragraphs-short"><div class=section-header__heading><h2 class=section-header__title>Model family</h2><p class=section-header__subtitle>Fine-tune the details and generate professional-grade audio with Lyria. Our family of music generation models can create clips and tracks, or deliver a constant stream of music.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-group card-group--model-card-group grid spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class="card-group__cards grid grid__column--span-12"><div class="model-card-group-container grid__column--span-4-xs grid__column--span-4-xs grid__column--span-4-sm grid__column--span-4-md grid__column--span-3-lg grid__column--span-3-xl"><article class="card card--model card--model--stretch card--is-link"><a aria-label="Try in Google Flow Music Lyria 3.5" data-event-content-name="Lyria 3.5 - Try in Google Flow Music" href="https://www.flowmusic.app/?utm_source=deepmind.google&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gdm&utm_content=" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-hidden=true class=card__overlay-link data-event-content-type=external data-gtm-event=select_content tabindex=-1 target=_blank> </a><div class=card__inner><div class="card__content-wrapper js-equal-height"><div class="w-block-contained block-contained"><div class="media-icon media-icon--contained js-media-icon media-icon--contained--outline" data-background-dark=#101218 data-background-light=#FFFFFF><div class=