lass="w-block-contained block-contained"><div class="media-icon media-icon--contained js-media-icon media-icon--contained--outline" data-background-dark=#101218 data-background-light=#FFFFFF><div class="media-icon--contained__inner media--aspect-1-1"><div class="media-icon__icon-wrapper media-icon--contained__icon"><div class="w-block-symbol block-symbol"><span class="media-icon__symbol icon-2xl-outlined" aria-hidden=true data-icon=music_note_spark> </span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="card__content card__content--medium card__content--text-hierarchy-scaled card__content--text-size-small"><h3 class=card__title>Lyria</h3><div class=card__text><p data-block-key=rxkry>Explore new genres, play with soundscapes, and find musical inspiration</p></div></div></div><div class="button-group button-group--stacked button-group--compact compact"><div class="w-block-external_button block-external_button"><a aria-label="Try in Google Flow Music" class="button button--primary icon-right" data-event-content-name="Lyria - Try in Google Flow Music" href="https://www.flowmusic.app/?utm_source=deepmind.google&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gdm&utm_content=" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-event-content-type=outbound data-gtm-event=select_content target=_blank> <div class=button__icon><span aria-hidden=true class=icon-md-outlined data-icon=keyboard_arrow_right></span></div> <div class=button__label>Try in Google Flow Music</div> </a></div></div></div></article></div><div class="model-card-group-container grid__column--span-4-xs grid__column--span-4-xs grid__column--span-4-sm grid__column--span-4-md grid__column--span-3-lg grid__column--span-3-xl"><article class="card card--model card--model--stretch card--is-link"><a aria-label="Learn more Lyria RealTime" data-event-content-name="Lyria RealTime - Learn more" aria-hidden=true class=card__overlay-link data-event-content-type=internal data-gtm-event=select_content href=/models/lyria/lyria-realtime/ tabindex=-1> </a><div class=card__inner><div class="card__content-wrapper js-equal-height"><div class="w-block-contained block-contained"><div class="media-icon media-icon--contained js-media-icon media-icon--contained--outline" data-background-dark=#101218 data-background-light=#FFFFFF><div class="media-icon--contained__inner media--aspect-1-1"><div class="media-icon__icon-wrapper media-icon--contained__icon"><div class="w-block-symbol block-symbol"><span class="media-icon__symbol icon-2xl-outlined" aria-hidden=true data-icon=play_circle_spark> </span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="card__content card__content--medium card__content--text-hierarchy-scaled card__content--text-size-small"><h3 class=card__title>Lyria RealTime</h3><div class=card__text><p data-block-key=rxkry>Designed for real-time, interactive music generation.</p></div></div></div><div class=card__button-group-wrapper><div class="button-group button-group--stacked button-group--stacked button-group--compact compact"><div class=button-group__buttons><a aria-label="Learn more about Lyria RealTime" class="button button--primary icon-right" data-event-content-name="Lyria RealTime - Learn more" data-event-content-type=internal data-gtm-event=select_content href=/models/lyria/lyria-realtime/> <div class=button__icon><span aria-hidden=true class=icon-md-outlined data-icon=chevron_right></span></div> <div class=button__label>Learn more</div> </a></div></div></div></div></article></div><div class="model-card-group-container grid__column--span-4-xs grid__column--span-4-xs grid__column--span-4-sm grid__column--span-4-md grid__column--span-3-lg grid__column--span-3-xl"><article class="card card--model card--model--stretch card--is-link"><a aria-label="Learn more Magenta RealTime" data-event-content-name="Magenta RealTime - Learn more" href="https://magenta.withgoogle.com/?utm_source=deepmind.google&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gdm&utm_content=" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-hidden=true class=card__overlay-link data-event-content-type=external data-gtm-event=select_content tabindex=-1 target=_blank> </a><div class=card__inner><div class="card__content-wrapper js-equal-height"><div class="w-block-contained block-contained"><div class="media-icon media-icon--contained js-media-icon media-icon--contained--outline" data-background-dark=#101218 data-background-light=#FFFFFF><div class="media-icon--contained__inner media--aspect-1-1"><div class="media-icon__icon-wrapper media-icon--contained__icon"><div class="w-block-symbol block-symbol"><span class="media-icon__symbol icon-2xl-outlined" aria-hidden=true data-icon=async> </span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="card__content card__content--medium card__content--text-hierarchy-scaled card__content--text-size-small"><h3 class=card__title>Magenta RealTime</h3><div class=card__text><p data-block-key=rxkry>Our Lyria open model explores the role of machine learning as a tool in the creative process.</p></div></div></div><div class=card__button-group-wrapper><div class="button-group button-group--stacked button-group--stacked button-group--compact compact"><div class=button-group__buttons><a aria-label="Learn more about Magenta RealTime" class="button button--primary icon-right" data-event-content-name="Magenta RealTime - Learn more" href="https://magenta.withgoogle.com/?utm_source=deepmind.google&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gdm&utm_content=" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-event-content-type=outbound data-gtm-event=select_content target=_blank> <div class=button__icon><span aria-hidden=true class=icon-md-outlined data-icon=chevron_right></span></div> <div class=button__label>Learn more</div> </a></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></section><hr class=divider><section class="section--carousel section-default spacer-block-none-bottom section-padding-top" id=capabilities><div class=section-container><div class="section-header section-header--small section-header--stacked section-header--paragraphs-right section-header--paragraphs-short"><div class=section-header__heading><h2 class=section-header__title>Your musical collaborator</h2><p class=section-header__subtitle>Lyria is our most advanced AI music generation tool. We’ve developed it with input from producers and musicians so it understands musicality – from rhythm to arrangement.</p></div><div class="section-header__paragraph section-header__paragraph--1-of-1"><p data-block-key=10cf4>Describe your track, then dial in the details you want. Lyria handles the complexity, putting new musical possibilities at your fingertips.</p></div></div><div class="w-block-card_carousel block-card_carousel"><section aria-label="Your musical collaborator" class="carousel-block carousel js-carousel spacer-block-none-bottom carousel--group-3" data-event-module-name="Your musical collaborator" aria-roledescription=carousel id=carousel-afc245f4-3565-46a4-8b8c-7e2787bc41ba role=region><div aria-atomic=true aria-live=polite class=sr-only id=carousel-announcer-carousel-afc245f4-3565-46a4-8b8c-7e2787bc41ba>Slide 1 of 5</div><div class=embla><div class=embla__container><div class="w-block-card block-card"><article class="card card--general"><div class=card__inner><div class=media-content-wrapper><div class="media__container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class=media-embed><div class="media-embed__container media-content-wrapper media--aspect-1-1 --scrim media-lightbox"><button class="media-embed__poster-control media-embed__poster-button lightbox__button" aria-hidden=true tabindex=-1 type=button></button><div class="media-embed__poster open-in-lightbox"><div class=media-embed__poster-image><div class="media__container has-dark-mode-alternative no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode-mobile"><picture class="image --scrim media--aspect-1-1 light-mode" aria-hidden=false><source sizes="(max-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1440px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="https://lh3.googleuserconten