ge anthem – produce crisp, clear tracks ready for your projects.</p></div></div></div></article></div></div></div><div class=carousel__pagination><div><div class=combo-button-group><button aria-controls=carousel-afc245f4-3565-46a4-8b8c-7e2787bc41ba aria-label=Previous class=js-carousel__button--prev><span aria-hidden=true class=icon-md-fill> <svg viewbox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden=true fill=currentColor height=24px role=presentation width=24px xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg><path d="M560.62-253.85 333.85-480.62l226.77-227.15 32.61 32.62-194.15 194.53 194.15 194.16-32.61 32.61Z"/></svg> </span></button><button aria-controls=carousel-afc245f4-3565-46a4-8b8c-7e2787bc41ba aria-label=Next class=js-carousel__button--next><span aria-hidden=true class=icon-md-fill> <svg viewbox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden=true fill=currentColor height=24px role=presentation width=24px xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg><path d="M536.92-480.62 342.77-675.15l32.61-32.62 226.77 227.15-226.77 226.77-32.61-32.61 194.15-194.16Z"/></svg> </span></button></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-none-bottom spacer-block-md-top section--has-background section--grey" id=prompt-guide><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-12"><div class="container two-up-block two-up-block--layout-five_seven two-up-block--text-size-medium two-up-block--margin-bottom-none two-up-block--spacing-default two-up-block--vertical-align-bottom spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class=wrapper><article class="card card--general card--is-link"><a aria-label="Learn how to prompt Creating your prompts" data-event-content-name="How to create effective prompts with Lyria - Learn how to prompt" aria-hidden=true class=card__overlay-link data-event-content-type=internal data-gtm-event=select_content href=/models/lyria/prompt-guide/ tabindex=-1> </a><div class=card__inner><div class="card__content card__content--medium card__content--text-hierarchy-scaled card__content--text-size-small"><h3 class=card__title>Creating your prompts</h3><div class=card__text><p data-block-key=buhxw>Keep it simple with a rough idea of what you want – like ‘an upbeat birthday tune’. Or describe the details for more control, like tempo and dynamics. Don’t forget to experiment as you go.</p></div></div><div class=card__footer><div class="button-group button-group--row button-group--compact compact"><div class=button-group__buttons><a class="button button--primary icon-none" data-event-content-name="How to create effective prompts with Lyria - Learn how to prompt" data-event-content-type=internal data-gtm-event=select_content href=/models/lyria/prompt-guide/> <div class=button__label>Learn how to prompt</div> </a></div></div></div></div></article></div><div class=wrapper><div class=media-content-wrapper><div class="media__container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media spacer-block-none-bottom"><figure class=media-video-figure><div class="media-video-container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media media--aspect-1-1 --scrim media-video-container--lazy" data-fallback-poster-dark=/static/images/fallback/video_poster_fallback_dark.4d55bc99efa6.jpg data-fallback-poster-light=/static/images/fallback/video_poster_fallback_light.57b61d57842a.jpg data-height=1080 data-width=1920><div class=video-wrapper><div class=media-video-poster><div class="media__container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media"><picture class="image --scrim media--aspect-1-1" aria-hidden=false><source sizes="(max-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1440px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/kces6H3DwKWxD8raDwf3NgyWZ-KDC8i3b5ufVbwT-wuttvuz0oyGWRRRyj0EwjrCkjo7p6M7mIa8IsPqo3cwOIQ3dAy0bgIYCf7m-Bu45vClnS-qKQ=w393-h393-n-nu-rw-lo 393w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/kces6H3DwKWxD8raDwf3NgyWZ-KDC8i3b5ufVbwT-wuttvuz0oyGWRRRyj0EwjrCkjo7p6M7mIa8IsPqo3cwOIQ3dAy0bgIYCf7m-Bu45vC