 your own lyrics, or generate them around specific subjects or themes. Then express them with realistic, natural, and nuanced vocals.</p></div></div><div class="w-block-card_carousel block-card_carousel"><section aria-label="Lyrics and vocals" class="carousel-block carousel js-carousel spacer-block-none-bottom carousel--full-width" data-event-module-name="Lyrics and vocals" aria-roledescription=carousel id=carousel-c5c91741-a375-43c0-96a1-6aa9c4da14d1 role=region><div aria-atomic=true aria-live=polite class=sr-only id=carousel-announcer-carousel-c5c91741-a375-43c0-96a1-6aa9c4da14d1>Slide 1 of 4</div><div class=embla><div class=embla__container><div class="w-block-card block-card"><article class="card card--general"><div class=card__inner><div class=media-content-wrapper><figure class="media__container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class="html spacer-block-none-bottom"><deepai-demo iframe-title="Retro Future - Audio Player" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/deepmind-media/DeepMind.com/Components/lyrics/index.html?audio=https://storage.googleapis.com/deepmind-media/DeepMind.com/Models/lyria/lyrics/lyria__pop_retro-future.mp3&vtt=https://storage.googleapis.com/deepmind-media/DeepMind.com/Models/lyria/lyrics/lyria__pop_retro-future.vtt&title=Retro+Future"></deepai-demo></div></figure></div></div></article></div><div class="w-block-card block-card"><article class="card card--general"><div class=card__inner><div class=media-content-wrapper><figure class="media__container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class="html spacer-block-none-bottom"><deepai-demo iframe-title="Alt-rock Anthem - Audio Player" src="https://storage.googleapis.com/deepmind-media/DeepMind.com/Models/lyria/lyrics/index.html?audio=lyria__rock_alt-rock-anthem.mp3&vtt=lyria__rock_alt-rock-anthem.vtt&title=Alt-rock+Anthem"></deepai-demo></div></figure></div></div></