16.2 6.88 7.07 7.08 7.07 16 0 8.93-7.07 16L512-480l213.08 213.08q6.69 6.69 6.88 15.8.19 9.12-6.88 16.2-7.08 7.07-16 7.07-8.93 0-16-7.07L480-448Z"/></svg></span></button></div><div class=media-embed__content></div></div></div></div></div><div class="card__content card__content--medium card__content--text-hierarchy-scaled card__content--text-size-small"><h3 class=card__title>Wyclef Jean</h3><div class=card__text><p data-block-key=ztaqx>Legendary producer Wyclef Jean gets hands on with a new style of creative expression. Watch Wyclef produce, curate and design alongside Music AI Sandbox.</p></div></div><div class=card__footer><div class="button-group button-group--row button-group--compact compact"><div class=button-group__buttons><a class="button button--text_link icon-right" data-event-content-name="Wyclef Jean - Watch" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l5Wpm4o6k1A" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-event-content-type=outbound data-gtm-event=select_content target=_blank> <div class=button__icon><span aria-hidden=true class=icon-md-outlined data-icon=keyboard_arrow_right></span></div> <div class=button__label>Watch</div> </a></div></div></div></div></article></div><div class="w-block-card block-card"><article class="card card--general"><div class=card__inner><div class=media-content-wrapper><div class="media__container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class=media-embed><div class="media-embed__container media-content-wrapper media--aspect-16-9 --scrim media-lightbox"><button class="media-embed__poster-control media-embed__poster-button lightbox__button" aria-hidden=true tabindex=-1 type=button></button><div class="media-embed__poster open-in-lightbox"><div class=media-embed__poster-image><div class="media__container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media"><picture class="image --scrim media--aspect-16-9" aria-hidden=false><source sizes="(max-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1440px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/IoXrcDxjw0n_TdFc9sHPULToeYWFLCKo97o298y69gZcD75Sl3Vgh1UtgIwnWiRnOJyhiIjb4sX5Jo_nQ7BNxbPjq3bq5eE9yfayI8snh9a87kvU=w393-h221-n-nu-rw-lo 393w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/IoXrcDxjw0n_TdFc9sHPULToeYWFLCKo97o298y69gZcD75Sl3Vgh1UtgIwnWiRnOJyhiIjb4sX5Jo_nQ7BNxbPjq3bq5eE9yfayI8snh9a87kvU=w480-h270-n-nu-rw-lo 480w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/IoXrcDxjw0n_TdFc9sHPULToeYWFLCKo97o298y69gZcD75Sl3Vgh1UtgIwnWiRnOJyhiIjb4sX5Jo_nQ7BNxbPjq3bq5eE9yfayI8snh9a87kvU=w640-h360-n-nu-rw-lo 640w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/IoXrcDxjw0n_TdFc9sHPULToeYWFLCKo97o298y69gZcD75Sl3Vgh1UtgIwnWiRnOJyhiIjb4sX5Jo_nQ7BNxbPjq3bq5eE9yfayI8snh9a87kvU=w768-h432-n-nu-rw-lo 768w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/IoXrcDxjw0n_TdFc9sHPULToeYWFLCKo97o298y69gZcD75Sl3Vgh1UtgIwnWiRnOJyhiIjb4sX5Jo_nQ7BNxbPjq3bq5eE9yfayI8snh9a87kvU=w1024-h576-n-nu-rw-lo 1024w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/IoXrcDxjw0n_TdFc9sHPULToeYWFLCKo97o298y69gZcD75Sl3Vgh1UtgIwnWiRnOJyhiIjb4sX5Jo_nQ7BNxbPjq3bq5eE9yfayI8snh9a87kvU=w1440-h810-n-nu-rw-lo 1280w" type=image/webp><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/IoXrcDxjw0n_TdFc9sHPULToeYWFLCKo97o298y69gZcD75Sl3Vgh1UtgIwnWiRnOJyhiIjb4sX5Jo_nQ7BNxbPjq3bq5eE9yfayI8snh9a87kvU=w1440-h810-n-nu" alt class=picture__image height=720 loading=lazy role=presentation width=1280></picture></div></div></div><div class="media-embed__controls media-video-controls deepai--dark media-video-controls--center"><button aria-label="Play video" class="media-embed__poster-control media-video-play-button button button--protected icon-center lightbox__button" type=button><div class=button__icon><span class="icon-md-fill play-icon"><svg viewbox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden=true fill=currentColor height=24px role=presentation width=24px xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg><path d="M340-291.46V-673q0-13.61 8.64-21.23 8.64-7.61 20.29-7.61 3.53 0 7.58.8 4.05.81 7.95 2.81l300.15 192.15q6.62 4.62 10.12 10.43 3.5 5.8 3.5 13.42 0 7.61-3.5 13.42t-10.12 10.43L384.46-266.23q-3.91 2-7.98 2.8-4.06.81-7.59.81-11.66 0-20.27-7.61-8.62-7.62-8.62-21.23Z"/></svg></span></div></button></div><div aria-hidden=true class=lightbox><div class=lightbox__overlay tabindex=-1></div><div aria-modal=true class=lightbox__content role=dialog tabindex=-1><iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/4unUMtDYwfw?enablejsapi=1&rel=0&origin=https%3A%2F%2Fdeepmind.google" title="Kicked Around" allowfullscreen frameborder=0 height=113 id=embed-iframe-cd81f4dc803d4e918554cd3219d8188d loading=lazy referrerpolicy=strict-origin-when-cross-origin width=200></iframe></div><button aria-label="Close video" class="lightbox__close button button--tonal icon-center" type=button><span class=icon-md-outlined><svg viewbox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden=true fill=currentColor height=24px role=presentation width=24px xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg><path d="M480-448 266.92-234.92q-6.69 6.69-15.8 6.88-9.12.19-16.2-6.88-7.07-7.08-7.07-16 0-8.93 7.07-16L448-480 234.92-693.08q-6.69-6.69-6.88-15.8-.19-9.12 6.88-16.2 7.08-7.07 16-7.07 8.93 0 16 7.07L480-512l213.08-213.08q6.69-6.69 15.8-6.88 9.12-.19 16.2 6.88 7.07 7.08 7.07 16 0 8.93-7.07 16L512-480l213.08 213.08q6.69 6.69 6.88 15.8.19 9.12-6.88 16.2-7.08 7.07-16 7.07-8.93 0-16-7.07L480-448Z"/></svg></span></button></div><div class=media-embed__content></div></div></div></div></div><div class="card__content card__content--medium card__content--text-hierarchy-scaled card__content--text-size-small"><h3 class=card__title>Dear Upstairs Neighbors (Official soundtrack)</h3><div class=card__text><p data-block-key=ztaqx>Scoring the animated short <em>Dear Upstairs Neighbors</em>, Yung Spielburg leant on Lyria to move beyond the limits of traditional instrumentation. The result is a collection of signature, sonic timbres that are not just unique, but technically impossible to manifest by any other means.</p></div></div><div class=card__footer><div class="button-group button-group--row button-group--compact compact"><div class=button-group__buttons><a class="button button--text_link icon-right" data-event-content-name="Dear Upstairs Neighbors (Official soundtrack) - Listen" href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLKzscojrC-okpPhk-NqNPVYw3wcsvY9az" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-event-content-type=outbound data-gtm-event=select_content target=_blank> <div class=button__icon><span aria-hidden=true class=icon-md-outlined data-icon=keyboard_arrow_right></span></div> <div class=button__label>Listen</div> </a></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></div><div class=carousel__pagination><div><div class=combo-button-group><button aria-controls=carousel-1677c1bf-2b1a-4620-9eef-e1b577af90f9 aria-label=Previous class=js-carousel__button--prev><span aria-hidden=true class=icon-md-fill> <svg viewbox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden=true fill=currentColor height=24px role=presentation width=24px xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg><path d="M560.62-253.85 333.85-480.62l226.77-227.15 32.61 32.62-194.15 194.53 194.15 194.16-32.61 32.61Z"/></svg> </span></button><button aria-controls=carousel-1677c1bf-2b1a-4620-9eef-e1b577af90f9 aria-label=Next class=js-carousel__button--next><span aria-hidden=true class=icon-md-fill> <svg viewbox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden=true fill=currentColor height=24px role=presentation width=24px xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg><path d="M536.92-480.62 342.77-675.15l32.61-32.62 226.77 227.15-226.77 226.77-32.61-32.61 194.15-194.16Z"/></svg> </span></button></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><hr class=divider><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-lg-bottom spacer-block-md-top" id=safety><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-12"><div class=grid__column--span-12><div class="section-header section-header--small section-header--stacked section-header--paragraphs-left section-header--paragraphs-short"><div class=section-header__heading><h2 class=section-header__title>Safety</h2></div><div class="section-header__paragraph section-header__paragraph--1-of-2"><p data-block-key=8hst8>We believe AI should enhance human creativity, not replace it. We’re working directly with artists to gather feedback and shape guardrails that address their concerns. By doing this, we ensure this tool empowers creators and helps them realize the possibilities of AI in their work.</p></div><div class="section-header__paragraph section-header__paragraph--2-of-2"><p data-block-key=8hst8>We use extensive filtering and data labeling to minimize harmful content in datasets and reduce the likelihood of harmful lyrics. Audio generation in Lyria has our latest privacy and safety features. All of our tracks are imperceptibly watermarked with SynthID technology, allowing you to detect whether music has been created or edited using AI.</p><div class="section-header__ctas button-group__buttons"><div class="button-group button-group--row"><div class=button-group__buttons><a class="button button--tonal icon-none" data-event-content-name="SynthID - Learn more" data-event-content-type=internal data-gtm-event=select_content href=/models/synthid/> <div class=button__label>Learn more</div> </a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><hr class=divider><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-lg-bottom spacer-block-md-top" id=limitations><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-12"><div class=grid__column--span-12><div class="section-header section-header--small section-header--stacked section-header--no-paragraphs section-header--paragraphs-left section-header--paragraphs-short"><div class=section-header__heading><h2 class=section-header__title>Limitations</h2><p class=section-header__subtitle>While Lyria can create a wide range of music, we’re still working on improving key capabilities. You should always carefully check that the tracks you create fit your vision.</p></div></div></div></div></section><hr class=divider><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-lg-bottom spacer-block-md-top" id=try-lyria><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-12"><div class=grid__column--span-12><div class="section-header section-header--small section-header--stacked section-header--no-paragraphs section-header--paragraphs-left section-header--paragraphs-short"><div class=section-header__heading><h2 class=section-header__title>Try Lyria</h2></div></div></div><div class="card-group card-group--model-card-group grid spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class="card-group__cards grid grid__column--span-12"><div class="model-card-group-container grid__column--span-4-xs grid__column--span-4-xs grid__column--span-4-sm grid__column--span-4-md grid__column--span-3-lg grid__column--span-3-xl"><article class="card card--model card--model--stretch card--is-link"><a aria-label="Try in Google Flow Music Google Flow Music" data-event-content-name="Google Flow Music - Try in Google Flow Music" href="https://www.producer.ai/?utm_source=deepmind.google&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gdm&utm_content=" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-hidden=true class=card__overlay-link data-event-content-type=external data-gtm-event=select_content tabindex=-1 target=_blank> </a><div class=card__inner><div class="card__content-wrapper js-equal-height"><div class="w-block-contained block-contained"><div class="media-icon media-icon--contained js-media-icon media-icon--contained--outline" data-background-dark=#101218 data-background-light=#FFFFFF><div class="media-icon--contained__inner media--aspect-1-1"><div class="media-icon__icon-wrapper media-icon--contained__icon"><div class="w-block-svg block-svg"><div class="media-icon__svg --size-2xl --light"><img class="image image--svg picture__image" alt role=presentation src=https://storage.googleapis.com/gdm-deepmind-com-prod-public/media/original_images/P2_ApBXR8azw8BBn/try__google-flow-music__light.svg></div><div class="media-icon__svg --size-2xl --dark"><img cla